Because the operation doesn't affect the list size directly, we can't directly refer to _size as OLD would not change. However, if we have access to the original count before the operation, we can compare it to the sum of the original count and x. If the original count was less than zero, we use zero. This would make sure that none of the asserted conditions would fail. 
